identity, Onsager cross-diffusion, Faraday gyrotropic light-cone eigenmodes, Zakharov–Shabat NLS
Lax pair, Unruh boost ladder, Verlinde entropic acceleration, Killing–Noether centralizers, and
irrotational/rotational Lie flows (`M₁ → M₁₀`). -/
inductive ParaKahlerModularNoetherStage : Type
  | M1_ParaKahlerHessianAndCurvature2Form
  | M2_ModularSurprisalAndBregmanThreePoint
  | M3_DraggedFrameAndOnsagerReciprocity
  | M4_CircularlyPolarizedLightConeAndFaradayGyrotropy
  | M5_FourWaveMixingAndZakharovShabatNLSLaxPair
  | M6_UnruhRindlerBoostAndWedgeLadder
